7.CONCLUSION

The Smart Study Planner is a simple Java project created to solve a common problem faced by students—organizing their
study activities and keeping track of their progress.

Through this project, I learned how to use Java, OOP concepts, ArrayList, methods, loops, conditions, and exception
handling in a practical application.

Although the current version is basic, it provides a good foundation for developing a more advanced study-management
system in the future.












